{"title": "Enervating Suffusion", "pageid": 28627, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Enervating_Suffusion", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Enervating Suffusion</b> is a passive feature that adds force damage to unarmed attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your unarmed attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant\" title=\"Gauntlet of the Tyrant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_the_Tyrant\" title=\"Gauntlet of the Tyrant\">Gauntlet of the Tyrant</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet\" title=\"Netherstone-Studded Gauntlet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet\" title=\"Netherstone-Studded Gauntlet\">Netherstone-Studded Gauntlet</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Servitor_of_the_Black_Hand_Gloves\" title=\"Servitor of the Black Hand Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Gloves_of_Cinder_and_Sizzle_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Servitor_of_the_Black_Hand_Gloves\" title=\"Servitor of the Black Hand Gloves\">Servitor of the Black Hand Gloves</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The extra <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span> damage granted by <b>Enervating Suffusion</b> is not added to <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">thrown</a> weapons (e.g., <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tavern_Brawler\" titl